    only use each of the following effects of \"Deep Sea Prima Donna\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF
    You can target 1 of your opponent's banished cards; add to your hand, or Special
    Summon, 1 Level 4 or lower WATER monster from your Deck, and if you do, add that
    target to their hand.\r\n\u25CF If this card is sent to the GY: You can target
    1 banished card; shuffle it into the Deck."
